20261119-17: Fix: in Artica, Importing an uploaded snapshot in the legacy encrypted format (.tar.gz.aes) works again, and an encrypted snapshot can also be opened with the server's own snapshot password.
20261119-17: Fix: in Artica, An uploaded snapshot no longer stays in the upload folder once it has been imported.
