20261119-17: Fix: in Artica Meta, The snapshot action that sends a snapshot to another node is now labelled "Copy to another node" and says that the original snapshot is kept.
20261119-17: Fix: in Artica Meta, The snapshot window no longer shows untranslated codes when a restore, an upload or a copy to other nodes starts, finishes or fails.
20261119-17: Add: in Artica, The System events page is redesigned: a plain-language summary, counters of critical problems, warnings and failed sign-ins with their last 7 days, level and source filters, readable source names and clear warnings before deleting events.
20261119-17: Add: in Artica, The reverse-proxy Admin clients page has been redesigned: it explains the Windows app in plain words, shows whether the access service can be reached, counts active, expiring and expired access files, flags files that can no longer connect and confirms downloads and deletions with their consequences.
20261119-17: Add: in Artica Meta, The node information window shows, for an HaCluster load balancer, how many nodes its farm has, with a link to manage them.
