20261119-17: Add: in Artica, The software delivery report of Artica Meta now uses the same clear report as Artica updates: plain verdict, failures first and each error explained in everyday words.
20261119-17: Fix: in Artica, An Artica Meta delivery where no server received the package is now reported as failed instead of completed.
20261119-17: Fix: in Artica, The Debian agent settings window is wider so its tabs no longer wrap onto a second line.
20261119-17: Add: in Artica, The update delivery report of Artica Meta now opens with a plain verdict, shows delivered, failed and waiting servers at a glance, lists failures first and explains each error in everyday words with the action that fixes it.
