20261116-17: Fix: in Artica Meta, The alerts window of a node no longer shows wrong labels ("Notifications settings", "Artica-PostFix events"), counts its alerts the same way as the bell of the agents list, and is now refused to accounts without Artica Meta privileges.
20261116-17: Add: in Artica Meta, The alerts window of a node now groups alerts by severity with a summary, shows when they were collected, warns when the node has stopped reporting, and highlights the current and available versions of an update.
20261116-17: Add: in Artica, The Parameters tab of a Docker image now shows how a container built from it starts (entrypoint, command, user, healthcheck, ports, volumes, masked environment variables, labels), the state of its linked containers and its security score, and tells a private-registry image apart from a Docker Hub check that failed.
