20261116-17: Add: in Artica Meta, The Features tab of a node now lists the whole Artica feature catalog of that node, lets you install or uninstall a feature with live progress, and shows which features are held by a Meta policy or must be installed from the node console.
20261116-17: Add: in Artica, The Activate / disable features page now reads the feature list computed by the Artica service, shows the progress of an installation started from the page, and tells when a server restart is required.
20261116-17: Fix: in Artica Meta, The license window of a node now shows the edition of that node instead of the edition of the Meta server, and no longer calls a paid license close to its renewal an evaluation.
