20261116-17: Add: in Artica Meta, The Hourly, Daily and 3 Days tabs of an agent metrics window show CPU usage, memory usage with the memory alerts of the period, and load average on a shared time axis, with averages, peaks, periods without data and a cursor that reads one moment across the three charts.
