20261115-17: Fix: in Artica Proxy, The ClamAV database update settings page shows an error when a setting is managed by an Artica Meta policy, instead of reporting a save that did not happen.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The File Sharing Windows client now points its workstation to the appliance's Windows Update cache when the cache is on, restores the workstation's original settings when the administrator turns it off or uninstalls the client, records each change in the Windows event log, and shows its status in a window opened from the tray icon.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica RDS Proxy, The Blocked addresses tab of the decoy targets shows whether decoys are armed, the block duration and the never-blocked networks, the time left on each block, a filter, and a confirmation that explains what lifting a block does.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Registries tab of the Docker Store shows the repository's description, stars and pulls, marks the tags already downloaded or downloading, filters the tags and confirms a download with a link to the Downloads page.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica Meta, The ClamAV policy editor sets the scan limits, signature databases, daemon watchdog, reload policy and signature exclusions of every attached node, and can be created from the configuration of an existing node.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica Meta, The node list shows a ClamAV tag that opens a read-only window with the ClamAV service, the last signature update and the freshness of each signature database.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Docker registry browser is now a Registries tab of the Docker Store, with its own header buttons, instead of a separate entry in the left menu.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Docker Relay agent connection test shows the server, agent and certificate before running, a clear verdict naming the first failing check, each step with what it verifies, the error and a hint, and the steps skipped after a failure.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The WAF Threats page now states whether infected uploads were blocked, on which website and from which address, lists the most detected signatures and source addresses, and filters infected, clean and scanner lines.
20261115-17: Fix: in Artica, The WAF Threats page now checks the administrator's privileges and no longer passes the search text to a system shell.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Docker Relay agent allowed Unix sockets tab shows which published backends use each socket and their health, lists refused backends with a one-click allow, flags container-engine sockets that give full control of the host and checks the path while you type.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The ClamAV update events tab now states the outcome of the last signature update, groups the log by update cycle, shows the database versions and filters errors, warnings and Artica messages.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The allowed networks of the Docker Relay agent show the addresses each network covers, its risk, the published backends that use it and the backends refused by the list, with a one-click allow and a preview of the saved network before saving.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The antivirus service events page now classifies each log line (detection, error, warning, database reload, start or stop), summarises the lines shown, highlights virus detections and lets you filter, expand and copy any line.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Docker Images page shows each image's security band with the findings behind its score, filters images at risk or not analysed, keeps delete actions in a menu and asks for confirmation before analysing every image.
20261115-17: Fix: in Artica, The Resize button and the volume size fields of the Docker volumes page no longer show raw labels, and the prune confirmation now says which volumes the installed Docker Engine really removes.
