20261115-17: Fix: in Artica, The Failover log now receives the VRRP state changes and health-check messages of keepalived, and they are forwarded to the remote syslog servers.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Docker containers list now shows each container health (with an Unhealthy filter), separates the image name from its tag, names the severity of runtime alerts, gathers the secondary actions in a More menu, and asks for confirmation before stopping, restarting or pausing a container.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Artica Meta agent settings have an "Enrollment account" tab to enroll the appliance on Artica Meta with the name and password of a group enrollment account.
