20261115-17: Fix: in Artica, The System tasks page now shows the names of the tasks instead of raw labels between braces.
20261115-17: Fix: in Artica, The System tasks page no longer reports as "Not installed" the tasks that are never scheduled on this appliance: they are shown as "Not applicable" with the reason.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica Meta, The "HaCluster client" label of the node list opens the HaCluster client status of that node (service, connections, load limits, load balancer, Active Directory).
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The HaCluster client dashboard has been redesigned: it now says plainly whether the load balancer sends traffic to this node (including the half-weight state that was not shown), names the health probes and thresholds correctly, separates checks, attachment and Active Directory settings, and asks for confirmation before taking the node out of the pool or disconnecting it from the cluster.
20261115-17: Fix: in Artica, The ClamAV signature updates now go through the global HTTP proxy configured in Artica, instead of trying a direct connection that times out.
20261115-17: Fix: in Artica RDS Proxy, The size limit of Web downloads now follows only the ClamAV settings that are really applied, so raising "Stream MAX Length" and "Maximal size of files" is enough to allow larger files.
20261115-17: Fix: in Artica, The ClamAV parameters no longer show two size fields that had no effect.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Docker runtime detection page was redesigned: Falco health with its own measurements, clickable severity counts, the most alerting containers, the alert storage against its 256 MB limit with lost or uncounted alerts, filter chips and alert details grouped by what, where and who.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica Meta, The proxy objects library has been redesigned: types grouped by policy family in the filter and when creating an object, the family shown on each row, objects filled by each node marked as such instead of showing 0 items, every citing policy listed, and the reason an object cannot be deleted shown before clicking.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Docker performance page has been redesigned: a progress and summary strip, top CPU, top memory and process tiles, sortable columns, memory bars against the real container limit, network and disk shown as totals since the container started, and the reason when a container cannot be measured.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Docker networks page has been redesigned: summary tiles for networks in use and unused, built-in and stack networks marked, the containers of each network listed with their state, the reason a network cannot be deleted shown before clicking, and a clearer driver choice when creating a network.
20261115-17: Fix: in Artica Meta, A tenant no longer sees the provider's global proxy objects, virtual network cards and links, except those cited by a policy applied to its own nodes.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The group picker of the Artica Meta agent list was redesigned: the current group stays visible and marked, every row is clickable, groups can be searched, DHCP cluster and denied updates are shown, and the dialog explains that it only filters the list.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The File Sharing instance page was redesigned: identity, measured storage with partition free space, memory against its real limit, network totals, a personal spaces switch, share access badges and links to workstations and the enrollment wizard, refreshed every 10 seconds.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The enrollment accounts of an Artica Meta agent group have been redesigned: one-click copy of the enrollment URL and command for any account, gateway status that names the missing condition, usage bars against the enrollment limit and a warning before an account expires.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica Reverse Proxy, The Docker Relay agents page has been redesigned: a relay status strip, five summary tiles, a clearer agent table with capacity and quota bars, an expandable row with the throughput chart and agent details, grouped actions that explain their effect, and a live countdown for enrollment tokens.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The page of a file-sharing instance has a Personal spaces On/Off button: it explains what personal spaces do and turns them on or off for the instance, keeping its other settings.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Windows workstation enrollment wizard now checks that personal spaces are enabled on the instance and enables them in one click, so a workstation no longer fails at the end of its connection.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Workstation settings tab of a file-sharing instance has been redesigned: live previews of the drive letter and of the browser search keyword, rules checked while typing, the values workstations currently receive, and a Restore defaults button.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The workstations page of a file-sharing instance now opens the enrollment wizard from its first button, already set to that instance.
20261115-17: Fix: in Artica Reverse Proxy, The backend check no longer reports "No backend configured" for a site whose backends are served through a Docker relay or a local Docker socket: these backends are now probed directly on their socket.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The Windows agents page now has a step-by-step enrollment wizard: it checks that the appliance is ready, gives the ready-to-paste installation command, creates the enrollment code from simple choices and explains what to do on the workstation.
20261115-17: Add: in Artica, The identity map retention dialog of the Windows agents page has been redesigned: three explained choices, the warning shown only for Keep indefinitely, a live summary of what the daily purge will delete, and errors shown inside the dialog.
20261115-17: Fix: in Artica, The Published port and host tile of the Windows agents page now shows a missing advertised host in red as Not selected, and a click opens the listener settings.
