20261108-17: Add: in Artica, The general settings of an RDS Proxy Meta policy show which settings the policy imposes at a glance, with a filter, per-section counters, a color palette with a login screen preview and the dependencies between settings.
20261108-17: Add: in Artica, The agent mTLS certificates page explains how outbound agent connections work, shows the gateway state with its session and stream capacity, lists pending enrollment tokens apart, and shows each certificate's remaining days with search and status filters.
20261108-17: Fix: in Artica, The agent mTLS certificates page no longer labels an active certificate as an "active" queue, no longer shows agents reached directly by Meta as disconnected, and records every enrollment, mode change, revocation and gateway start or stop in the administrator audit log.
