20261108-17: Add: in Artica Meta, An RDS Proxy policy now manages the web objects of its WEB targets (upstream proxies with their password stored encrypted and never displayed, PAC files uploaded or downloaded by each node, trusted certificates) and its session patterns, global or tied to one of its access rules.
