20261108-17: Add: in Artica, The Proxy tab of a Meta agent shows which proxy the agent uses, keeps the stored password when the field is left empty, and reports an agent refusal instead of a false success.
20261108-17: Add: in Artica, A Meta proxy policy can now define the allowed remote ports of its nodes (port or range, HTTP, SSL), and set the ICP, HTCP and SNMP ports and the remote ports switches from a new Ports section.
20261108-17: Add: in Artica, The Artica Meta agents list shows a fleet summary that doubles as filters, filters by state, type, Debian version and agents needing attention, and gives each agent readable health bars with a CPU sparkline, its versions, license, pending APT upgrades and a single actions menu.
20261108-17: Fix: in Artica, Enrolling an agent from the Artica Meta agents list now confirms the result instead of failing silently, and deleting an agent is reserved to Meta administrators.
