20261108-17: Add: in Artica, The general whitelist of a Meta policy now adds, enables, disables and deletes entries from a single window, refuses an invalid or duplicate entry before sending it, and filters the list by pattern, description or type as you type.
20261108-17: Add: in Artica, The hotfixes of the Artica Meta repository are grouped by service pack with the newest one marked, can be searched by date, service pack or MD5, filtered by service pack and paged, and each MD5 can be copied in one click.
20261108-17: Fix: in Artica, Deleting a hotfix from the Artica Meta repository now warns that a hotfix still published by Artica comes back at the next synchronization, and is reserved to Meta administrators.
20261108-17: Add: in Artica, The general blacklist of a Meta policy now adds several entries from the same window, checks them before sending, reports how many were added or already listed, and filters the list as you type.
20261108-17: Add: in Artica, The Artica Meta repository status shows whether the mirror is up to date, the live synchronization steps, the last error, the content breakdown, the disk usage of its partition and what is mirrored, and the download mode can be switched in one click.
20261108-17: Fix: in Artica, The Launch updates button of the Artica Meta repository now confirms that the synchronization has started instead of failing silently, and the repository settings can only be changed by Meta administrators.
20261108-17: Add: in Artica, The general whitelist of a Meta policy opens in a searchable table where each entry can be enabled, disabled or deleted, with new entries added from a separate dialog.
20261108-17: Add: in Artica, The delivery status of a Meta policy now counts up-to-date, in-progress, failing, rejected and suspended nodes, lists the problems first, and shows each node's report setting by setting on demand.
20261108-17: Add: in Artica, The general blacklist of a Meta policy opens in a searchable table where each entry can be deleted, with new entries added from a separate dialog.
