20261107-17: Fix: in Artica Sandbox, The performance page legend now writes the report phase with a capital letter, like the other phases.
20261107-17: Add: in Artica, The Disks tab of a remote agent now opens on a summary of disks, capacity, S.M.A.R.T health and the fullest filesystem, lists filesystems by mount point with their real free space, and shows each disk as a card with its health, partitions and a Refresh button.
