20261107-17: Fix: in Artica, On a node running Artica, the DNS servers, hostname and static routes sent by the Meta console are now stored in the Artica configuration and applied by Artica itself, instead of being overwritten at its next network rebuild.
20261107-17: Fix: in Artica, The Web console PHP service no longer starts without its core PHP extensions on appliances without systemd, and repairs itself automatically when this happens.
20261107-17: Fix: in Artica, The Meta console now keeps showing the last known network interfaces, hostname, DNS servers and routing of a node that no longer responds, with a banner telling when they were received.
20261107-17: Add: in Artica, The Meta agent detail page now opens on a redesigned identity tab showing the agent state, its connection, software, maintenance and certificate in four cards, with direct switches for blacklisting and management.
