20261106-17: Fix: in Artica, The Proxy, LDAP, Categories, HaCluster and ssh-mtls Windows consoles now read the connection data of client certificates under Artica Tech's IANA number first, and still accept certificates issued before this change.
20261106-17: Add: in Artica Reverse Proxy, The Parameters tab now shows each setting group as a card, tells whether the Prometheus exporter and the Active Health Check Daemon are actually running with a one-click restart, warns while debug mode is on, and explains why Redis caching cannot be edited.
