20261106-17: Fix: in Artica Reverse Proxy, A chart of the Web Application Firewall status page that cannot be read now shows a warning instead of "No data", and the other charts still display.
20261106-17: Fix: in Artica Reverse Proxy, The "Threats by day" chart of the Web Application Firewall status page shows one bar per day with its year, instead of duplicate bars.
