20261106-17: Add: in Artica Reverse Proxy, A new WAF false positives page lists the WAF rules that block legitimate visitors on one path of a site, with the evidence behind each proposal (clean and suspicious IP addresses, hits over 7 days, blocked requests, main ISPs) and the exact exclusion, applied or rejected in one click after confirmation.
