20261104-17: Add: in Artica, The Windows Update client tool window lets the administrator choose between the Microsoft super-cache, now the default, and the experimental update source mode.
20261104-17: Add: in Artica, The AI assistant can read the DNS cache counters since the service started: queries, cache hit rate, recursion time, cache memory and answers by response code.
