20261104-17: Add: in Artica, The Docker images page now shows a security score for each image, opens a detailed report of its vulnerabilities, secrets and configuration problems, lets administrators schedule the nightly refresh, and warns when images are not audited because the CVE scanner is not installed or enabled.
