20261103-17: Fix: in Artica RDS Proxy, Session openings and closings now show their policy in the access events and the session history.
20261103-17: Fix: in Artica RDS Proxy, The access events table keeps the same column widths for every filter.
20261103-17: Fix: in Artica, Windows clients using the Windows Update service no longer get stuck on "We couldn't connect to the update service" after the update catalog is refreshed or the service restarts.
