20261014-17: Add: in Artica, The RDS Proxy now converts finished session recordings to MP4 videos automatically when the installed RDS Proxy package includes video support.
20261014-17: Fix: in Artica, Raw RDS Proxy session recordings that cannot be converted to video are now deleted when the retention period expires instead of accumulating forever.
20261014-17: Fix: in Artica, The RDS Proxy video recording options are now greyed out with an explanation when the installed package has no video support.
20261014-17: Fix: in Artica, Several RDS Proxy second-factor and SIEM labels were displayed as raw codes instead of translated text.
20261014-17: Fix: in Artica, Starting a second snapshot restore while one is running no longer reports a false failure on the running restore.
20261014-17: Add: in Artica, The progress bar now advances while a snapshot is downloaded from the remote storage, instead of staying still until the end.
20261014-17: Fix: in Artica, Logs and anonymized support bundles no longer hide unrelated values whose name ends with sig, such as DKIM signatures.
20261014-17: Fix: in Artica, The snapshots NAS settings now refuse an invalid NAS address with an error message instead of saving it silently.
