20261014-17: Fix: in Artica, GlusterFS volume names starting with a dash or equal to "all" are now refused, so such a name can no longer be read as a command option and return the details of another volume.
20261014-17: Fix: in Artica, Stopping GlusterFS from the Web console now keeps the service stopped instead of being restarted by the watchdog a few minutes later, and a server shutdown no longer counts as a stop.
20261014-17: Add: in Artica, The AI assistant now reports the state of GlusterFS (service, pool, volumes, bricks, self-heal and Artica mounts), can start, restart, stop, install or uninstall it on approval, and on its own restarts glusterd or remounts an Artica mount that stayed down, within strict limits.
20261014-17: Fix: in Artica, The firewall pages no longer write to the firewall database themselves: every change now goes through the validated configuration service, which also schedules the rebuild.
20261014-17: Add: in Artica, A firewall rule can again send its connections through a chosen link of the link balancer; they move to the other links while that link is down.
