20261012-17: Fix: in Artica, The RDS Proxy status page now always shows the authenticator version in its top tile, instead of an empty value followed by a stray slash.
20261012-17: Fix: in Artica Proxy, The number of sites shown for a web category in the Windows categories console is now exact for categories of up to 10,000 sites, instead of drifting after successive changes.
20261012-17: Fix: in Artica Proxy, A web category site recorded with a leading "www." can now be removed or moved from the Windows categories console, and every site added is recorded without "www.".
