20261012-17: Add: in Artica Proxy, The Windows categories console no longer lists official categories that hold no site.
20261012-17: Add: in Artica Proxy, The Windows categories console shows its version number in its window title.
20261012-17: Fix: in Artica Proxy, Moving sites between web categories from the Windows console now works for sites that are also listed in another category.
20261012-17: Add: in Artica, The LDAP Windows console shows its version number in the title of its main window.
20261012-17: Fix: in Artica, The DNS cache service no longer stops and restarts in a loop on a server whose name ends in ".localhost" (the default name of a new installation).
