20261012-17: Add: in Artica, The categories service now sends the official categories descriptions to the Windows console translated into the console language.
20261012-17: Add: in Artica Proxy, The web categories Windows console has an "Add site" button that files one website into a category found by search, with an option to move it from the category that already holds it.
20261012-17: Add: in Artica Proxy, In the web categories Windows console, the selected websites can be copied to the clipboard (right-click Copy or Ctrl+C).
20261012-17: Fix: in Artica Proxy, The web categories Windows console translates "Free Edition" in category names and no longer shows untranslated description codes.
