20261012-17: Add: in Artica Proxy, The Timeouts tab of the general settings now shows each value as a tile and opens the settings in a dialog when a tile is clicked.
20261012-17: Fix: in Artica, Durations of exactly one minute, hour or day are now translated instead of showing a raw placeholder.
20261012-17: Fix: in Artica, Clicking the edit icon on the right of a settings tile no longer opens the same dialog twice.
20261012-17: Add: in Artica, The mail quarantine can classify newsletters and automatic notifications as Infomail and deliver, tag or hold them per domain, with a dedicated section in the quarantine report.
20261012-17: Add: in Artica, The categories catalogue service can now tell when the next compilation of the web-filtering and DNS category databases is scheduled.
