20260930-17: Fix: in Artica, The Artica AI service socket is now reachable by the web console, which could otherwise not talk to the assistant at all.
20260930-17: Add: in Artica, The Artica AI dashboard now shows when the service is not installed and offers an Install button with its progress bar.
