20260930-17: Fix: in Artica, When a step of an AI action fails, the steps already applied are now undone, and only those.
20260930-17: Fix: in Artica, The AI assistant now lists the most recent notifications first, even when the event log holds thousands of other events.
20260930-17: Fix: in Artica, AI memory sessions are now private to the user who created them, and reading an unknown session no longer creates one.
20260930-17: Fix: in Artica, AI documentation and knowledge searches no longer fail on questions containing punctuation such as question marks or apostrophes.
