20260930-17: Fix: in Artica, The AI assistant pages of the Web console now act on behalf of the logged-in administrator with the rights of his profile, refuse visitors without an administration session, and protect their forms against cross-site requests.
20260930-17: Fix: in Artica, Only system administrators can now change the privileges of an administrator group.
